-- Argent Tournament: jousting valiants and champions (the "Grand Melee" and "Among the Champions" fights).
-- The 20 faction valiants and champions had a ScriptName with no script behind it and so did not fight. They get the
-- SmartAI of 3.3.5: gossip fight start, run up and charge, thrust and shield-breaker, yield at low health with the
-- text, quest credit and the Bested aura. The gossip options only show to a mounted player with a lance who has
-- the quest and has not bested that valiant yet. The Stormwind Champion had no mount.

UPDATE `creature_template` SET `AIName` = 'SmartAI', `ScriptName` = '' WHERE `entry` IN (33285,33306,33382,33383,33384,33558,33559,33561,33562,33564,33738,33739,33740,33743,33744,33745,33746,33747,33748,33749);

DELETE FROM `smart_scripts` WHERE `source_type` = 0 AND `entryorguid` IN (33285,33306,33382,33383,33384,33558,33559,33561,33562,33564,33738,33739,33740,33743,33744,33745,33746,33747,33748,33749);

